\mu^*(\B^i) = \sum_{r = 0}^i (\B^r \times \P^{i-r} + \P^r \times \B^{i-r})
\]
where $\mu^*$ is the pullback on motivic cohomology induced by the multiplication map $\mu \colon H\Fb^{\Ab^1}_p \otimes H\Fb^{\Ab^1}_p \to H\Fb^{\Ab^1}_p$;

