\caption{\label{fig:fig0} \textbf{Domain schematic diagram.} Example of an ellipsoid-shaped domain $\Omega$ of length-scale $R$. A positive-charge influx current is sent through a first narrow window $\p\Omega_{A_1}$, while on $\p\Omega_{A_2}$ ionic concentrations are set to be constant.}
