The performance metrics are tabulated in Tab. \ref{testdataset_var_extrapolation_voronoi}. Polynomial regression with degree {2} shows the best performance for the given data and is therefore selected. Figure \ref{fig:test_XGB_PR_max_lpf_prediction_extrapolation} 
