\subsubsection{Surface Collision Analysis}
As shown in Table \ref{collision_percentages},
SimCortex achieves a $>$90 \% relative reduction in inter-surface collisions compared to baselines CFPP and V2C, with collision rates reported as the percentage of mesh faces (\%Face) exhibiting overlaps, computed using PyMeshLab. 
