 Deschapelles & Lewis & 1821 & $0$ & $1$ & $2$ & P \& 1 & \cite[p.27]{Sergeant1934}\,\cite[p.878]{Murray1913} \\ 
 de la Bourdonnais & Lewis & 1823 & $5$ & $2$ & $0$ & & \cite[p.882]{Murray1913}\,\cite[p.184]{Hooper1984}\\ 
